OL,3,GNEWSABid in for #98m to fund new
OL,4,Amaternity building
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision on a bid for a new #98m
OL,7,Fmaternity building at Ipswich Hospital
OL,8,Fto replace a 50-year-old tower block
OL,9,Fwill be made by the end of the month.
OL,11,FAn East Suffolk and North Essex NHS
OL,12,FFoundation Trust (ESNEFT) spokesperson
OL,13,Ftold the BBC an "expression of
OL,14,Finterest" had been made to NHS England
OL,15,FEstates Safety Fund for national
OL,16,Ffunding for a new maternity and
OL,17,Fneonatal centre.
OL,19,FHealth Minister Karin Smyth was asked
OL,20,Fabout the bid in Parliament on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
